================================================================================
Embedding models (retrieval index — not training-data synthesis)
================================================================================

The on-device retrieval vector index is built with a local embedding model
(lib/embedding/providers.py::EMBEDDING_MODEL_REGISTRY carries per-model license
metadata; mirrored here).

  - BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 — MIT (default `st` provider model)
    https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5
  - BAAI/bge-m3, BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 — MIT
  - Alibaba-NLP/gte-large-en-v1.5 — Apache-2.0
  - nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5 — Apache-2.0
  - Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B — Apache-2.0
  - sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 — Apache-2.0

The optional grounded-answer cross-encoder reranker (ED4ALL_RERANK_PROVIDER,
default off; lib/retrieval/reranker.py::RERANKER_MODEL_REGISTRY) re-orders
already-retrieved passages with a local cross-encoder. All candidates are
license-clean:

  - BAAI/bge-reranker-base — MIT (default model)
    https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-reranker-base
  - BAAI/bge-reranker-large — MIT
  - BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 — Apache-2.0

